cement-rotary-kiln-clinker, autoclave-composite-cure, geothermal-binary-orc, and tire-curing-press. Domain constraint: current ceiling while cell-outlet pH > 2.80 with header Cl2 still inside the healthy band. Sensor delta: +cell voltage, +anolyte magmeter, +header Cl2 GC, +cell-outlet pH, -any freeze-dryer / tin-bath / cold-box / coater / potline / PEM stack / hub encoder / insole GRF / VIM pyrometer / reformer TMT / kiln zirconia / smelt IR / autoclave ply-TC / ORC shell-pressure / mold-platen TC